{
	"id": "effect-promise",
	"text": "Before we move on, we should look at one last constructor. This concerns my arch enemy abstraction, the loathsome Promise. Here is a Promise that fetches your sensor data. You run it each morning before exiting your bunker. Today the air is clear, so you crank open the airlock and spend your day frolicking and collecting meat. The next morning you run it again. The exact same reading as yesterday! What providence! So you hurriedly crank open the airlock and proceed to die a slow and agonizing death.",
